From 7d8b944a4b5f317c18998bb84810eea90db5d364 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenATV <oe-alliance@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 20:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] hisi: switch HDMI refresh without changing HIFB GLES size

Expose refresh-rate variants only for the physical output resolution selected
by Enigma2 at Kodi startup. Switch the HDMI timing through videomode while
keeping the HIFB and Mali EGL GUI surface fixed, so 23.976 fps playback can use
24 Hz without reintroducing the cropped or unstable Kodi OSD.

---
diff --git a/xbmc/windowing/egl/EGLNativeTypeMali.cpp b/xbmc/windowing/egl/EGLNativeTypeMali.cpp
index f5c26b8..49fffc2 100644
--- a/xbmc/windowing/egl/EGLNativeTypeMali.cpp
